4444,"y":0.074127906795695475,"h":0.014534884083027722,"text":"First, Second and Third Conditionals,"},{"h":0.014693877551020362,"w":0.13777777671813951,"text":"wish and if only","x":0.50444444635204133,"y":0.088571428458974477},{"h":0.010204081632653073,"y":0.11918367339664959,"text":"First Conditional","w":0.14444443702697751,"x":0.50666667218095573},{"text":"• We use First Conditional sentences (if + Present Simple,","y":0.13510204096040079,"x":0.50444445531262627,"w":0.44222221374511717,"h":0.013153772938008235},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"will\/could\/might + infinitive) to talk about things which","x":0.52222222845260946,"w":0.41111110687255858,"y":0.14970930251185766},{"x":0.51999999632516813,"w":0.36888889312744144,"text":"will happen in the future under certain conditions:","y":0.16279069729345141,"h":0.013127670288086035},{"h":0.011836734693877582,"w":0.3266666412353515,"text":"If you leave a message, they' call you back","y":0.18163265297401521,"x":0.5222222382045465},{"x":0.52222223123855227,"text":"You might get lost unless you take a map with you.","y":0.19912790714848561,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.38222221374511722},{"text":"Second Conditional","w":0.16888887405395503,"h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.50666667667672616,"y":0.22081632652691496},{"w":0.44222221374511717,"y":0.23836734713206409,"h":0.011632652671969668,"text":"• We use Second Conditional sentences (if + Past Simple,","x":0.50222221909040454},{"x":0.52222222320589184,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"would\/could\/might + infinitive) to talk about present or","w":0.41777778625488282,"y":0.25290697691592745},{"y":0.26598837219209026,"x":0.51999999678594311,"w":0.4311111068725586,"text":"future situations or states which are impossible or unlikely:","h":0.011627906487912454},{"x":0.52222222136144736,"h":0.011836734693877582,"y":0.28326530622534085,"text":"Would you tell him the truth if he asked you?","w":0.33777778625488286},{"text":"I'm sure you could do that if I showed you how.","